OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA bright
OL,6,Fevening across the region, with plenty
OL,7,Fof late evening sunshine for all,
OL,8,Falthough potentially hazy at times.
OL,9,FRemaining dry overnight with clear
OL,10,Fspells developing. Rather warm
OL,11,Fovernight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FDry, with clear or sunny
OL,14,Fspells, cloud increase across the west
OL,15,Fat times making skies a little hazy.
OL,16,FFeeling very warm and humid.
